  "finding": "Every observable with-skill run created a second session ledger. Two distinct causes: (a) the agent re-planned to a larger mode and, because `plan` refuses to overwrite an existing ledger, had to create a new file \u2014 the first ledger was never used; (b) eval-3 spent its quick ledger to exactly its 5/5 ceiling and then continued under a fresh ledger, which routes around the cumulative ceiling the ledger exists to enforce.",
